Z||000000||TheFiero64||09-03-2000||08:46 PM||||Today <B>NEFA</B><I>(New England Fiero Association)</I> went to the SPINDLES AUTO FEST in Marshfield MA. We had 8 Fieros in our class.  Phil Randolph took 1st place, Chris Hatch took 2nd, & Rob and Renee Dabrowski took 3rd. It was an overcast day but it didn't rain. The only discrepancy was that we were stuck behind a bunch of ricers <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">, But I think Gokart took care of that with his <B>"Pee on Rice</B> Decal he was displaying.(Way to go Marc) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Look at pic below. I will post a link to my pics and more info soon on this thread. It was a wonderful day. Chris was very happy on his first win. Congratulations Chris.<P>Were Behind Rice  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sep03^18.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Gokart||09-03-2000||11:06 PM||||At least it wasn't as insulting if we were put next to the fire engines <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> Yah, those boys jaws dropped to the ground when they saw my decal I had made there <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> Congrats on your first trophy gtsonly <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Looking forward to seeing all you guys again soon! Rutland show anyone?!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Gokart_sig_1.gif"> <P>Marc                     87GT||||reg||10
