Z||000003||gtsonly||09-04-2000||01:06 PM||||i just wanted to take a quick minute and let all of you know it was an absolute pleasure to meet you all and thank you for a day of fun. you all wonderful and i look forward to meeting you and many others in future events. i hope to be at the rutland ma. show, depending on if i am in back or knee surgery. i look forward to seeing you all again!!!<BR>   chris hatch<BR>   1986.5 gt with t-tops||||reg||10
